TakeBuy_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── when units zero
│  └── it should revert with InvalidAmount
├── when max assets zero
│  └── it should revert with InvalidAmount
├── when offer is a buy offer
│  └── it should revert with WrongOfferSide
├── when market not allowlisted for vault
│  └── it should revert with MarketNotAllowed
├── when reentered through token transfer hook
│  └── it should revert with ReentrancyGuardReentrantCall
├── when take yields no credit delta
│  └── it should revert with NoCreditDelta
├── when take succeeds
│  ├── it should pull max assets from the vault
│  ├── it should reset midnight allowance to zero
│  ├── it should sweep the remainder back to the vault
│  ├── it should leave zero loan token in the adapter
│  ├── it should increase the vault credit
│  └── it should emit MidnightMarketAction deposit
└── when position accrued loss
   └── it should exclude the slash from the credit delta
